        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠺᠠᠰᠢᠺ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠭᠡᠶᠢᠭᠦᠯᠦᠭᠴᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ygei geigylygci</transcript>
          <definition> Consonant not followed by a vowel.</definition>
